# Ollama Chat Project Structure

This is a full-stack chat application with real-time SSE (Server-Sent Events) functionality, integrating Ollama AI and Selenium web browsing capabilities.

## Architecture Overview

The project follows **Clean Architecture** principles with clear separation of concerns:

### Backend Structure (`backend/`)
- **Entry Point**: [server.js](mdc:backend/src/server.js) - Main Express server with SSE endpoints
- **Application Layer**: [chatService.js](mdc:backend/src/application/chatService.js) - Core business logic
- **Domain Layer**: [chatHistory.js](mdc:backend/src/domain/chatHistory.js) - Domain models and entities
- **Infrastructure Layer**: 
  - [ollamaClient.js](mdc:backend/src/infrastructure/ollamaClient.js) - Ollama AI integration
  - [seleniumService.js](mdc:backend/src/infrastructure/seleniumService.js) - Web browsing capabilities
  - [seleniumChatAdapter.js](mdc:backend/src/infrastructure/seleniumChatAdapter.js) - Selenium adapter for chat

### Frontend Structure (`frontend/`)
- **Main App**: [App.js](mdc:frontend/src/App.js) - Root React component with chat ID management
- **Components**: [ChatBox.js](mdc:frontend/src/components/ChatBox.js) - Main chat interface with SSE handling

### Testing Structure (`backend/tests/`)
- **Unit Tests**: `tests/unit/` - Individual component testing
- **Integration Tests**: `tests/integration/` - End-to-end API testing
- **Configuration**: [jest.config.js](mdc:backend/jest.config.js) - Jest testing setup

## Key Technologies
- **Backend**: Node.js, Express.js, ES6 modules
- **Frontend**: React 18, Styled Components
- **AI Integration**: LangChain, Ollama
- **Web Automation**: Selenium WebDriver
- **Testing**: Jest with Babel transpilation
- **Real-time**: Server-Sent Events (SSE)

## Development Commands
- `npm run dev` - Start both backend and frontend concurrently
- `npm run dev:backend` - Backend only with nodemon
- `npm run dev:frontend` - Frontend only
- `npm test` - Run Jest tests
- `npm run test:coverage` - Generate test coverage report